# valgrind suppressions for tmux (gym/valgrind/vg-tmux).
#
# None are needed: on Ubuntu 24.04 aarch64 (glibc 2.39, libevent 2.1.12,
# ncurses 6.4) the server and clients report no errors from those libraries,
# and only definite and indirect leaks are reported (memory still reachable
# at exit, such as the global options and terminfo, is not). Add an entry
# here only for an error inside a library that tmux cannot cause, with the
# reason.
